   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tinted Window Views</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Tinted Window Views\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication with the original photographs: eight photographs of two similar rooms in a hotel in Huangshan, China, one on the 2nd and one on the 4th floor, taken between 3 and 4 pm from 1.0 m in front of the window with a 13 mm wide-angle lens, with the window clear or covered with a bronze, blue or red tinted film. Participants give their gender and age, then rate each photograph on the paper's 13 questions about the room's lighting, visual capacity and the view through the window, each on a 5-point bipolar scale from 1 (most negative) to 5 (most positive), as printed in the paper's Table 1. As in the paper, each participant gets one of three colour orders: clear-bronze-blue-red, red-clear-bronze-blue or blue-clear-red-bronze. Rebuilt from Yu, Wang & Liang (2024), Exploration on Effects of Tinted Glazing on Outdoor Views and Visual Experience Inside Hotel, Buildings 14(6): 1799, with the photographs from its Figures 2 and 3 and the questions from Table 1 (CC BY 4.0). Image ids: C2, BZ2, BL2, R2 (2nd floor) and C4, BZ4, BL4, R4 (4th floor), C = clear, BZ = bronze, BL = blue, R = red; the colour order each participant got is in sequence; answers are in rating, keyed by image id, with item codes q1-q13 in the order of Table 1; each image's tint and floor and each item's anchors are stored in the page's original-study block. Analysis as in the paper: Friedman's ANOVA across the eight window conditions for each question, then Wilcoxon signed-rank tests between pairs of conditions with Bonferroni-Holm correction. The paper (45 online respondents aged 18-50, 23 women and 22 men, recruited through the investigators' network at the end of 2022) found no significant differences between the same colour on the two floors; comfort fell in the order clear > bronze > blue > red, bronze was as pleasant and acceptable as clear, the red window hurt visual capacity most, followed by blue, and all tints disturbed the view outside. Differences from the original study: (1) the paper does not say in what order the two floors were shown; here the 2nd-floor photographs come first, then the 4th-floor ones, each in the participant's colour order; (2) the low anchor of question 10 is printed as 'Very full' in the paper, which appears to be an error; here it reads 'Very unpleasant'; (3) the instruction text, the information sheet and the wording of the gender and age questions are ours, and the gender question adds an 'other or prefer not to say' option; (4) anyone can take part; (5) the photographs are the figure panels cropped to remove the panel letters (about 670-680 px wide), which trims a narrow strip at the left of each photograph.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"photos\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other or prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"title\": \"Age (years)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"min\": 18,\n      \"max\": 100\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"photos\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"sequence\",\n      \"title\": \"Colour order assigned to this participant (set by the page)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"C-BZ-BL-R\",\n        \"text\": \"clear-bronze-blue-red\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"R-C-BZ-BL\",\n        \"text\": \"red-clear-bronze-blue\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"BL-C-R-BZ\",\n        \"text\": \"blue-clear-red-bronze\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"matrix\",\n      \"name\": \"rating\",\n      \"title\": \"Imagine you are in this room. Rate each question from 1 to 5.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rows\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q1\",\n        \"text\": \"With this lighting, the whole room looks?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q2\",\n        \"text\": \"What is the level of light on the desktop?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q3\",\n        \"text\": \"The textures and contours of the interior items are?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q4\",\n        \"text\": \"The colours of the objects in the room look?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q5\",\n        \"text\": \"The reading problems in this lighting situation are?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q6\",\n        \"text\": \"The contrast between the black and white writing on the paper is?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q7\",\n        \"text\": \"The level of glare you perceive is?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q8\",\n        \"text\": \"The view through the window is?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q9\",\n        \"text\": \"What is the colour of the view from the window?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q10\",\n        \"text\": \"Your mood towards the view from the window was?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q11\",\n        \"text\": \"The view from the window was?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q12\",\n        \"text\": \"In general, the atmosphere created by the lighting is?\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"q13\",\n        \"text\": \"Is it acceptable to live in this window-conditioned light environment?\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"columns\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"5\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Yu, Wang & Liang (2024) Table 1; 1 = most negative, 5 = most positive. Keyed by image id.\"\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"tw-original\">{\"source\": \"Yu, Wang & Liang (2024) Buildings 14(6): 1799\", \"n\": 45, \"images\": [\"C2\", \"BZ2\", \"BL2\", \"R2\", \"C4\", \"BZ4\", \"BL4\", \"R4\"], \"sequences\": [[\"C\", \"BZ\", \"BL\", \"R\"], [\"R\", \"C\", \"BZ\", \"BL\"], [\"BL\", \"C\", \"R\", \"BZ\"]], \"anchors\": {\"q1\": [\"Very uncomfortable\", \"Very comfortable\"], \"q2\": [\"Very insufficient\", \"Very sufficient\"], \"q3\": [\"Very faint\", \"Very accurate\"], \"q4\": [\"Very unnatural\", \"Very natural\"], \"q5\": [\"Very laboured\", \"Very easy\"], \"q6\": [\"Very unclear\", \"Very clear\"], \"q7\": [\"Unbearable\", \"Not at all\"], \"q8\": [\"Very blurred\", \"Very clear\"], \"q9\": [\"Very unnatural\", \"Very natural\"], \"q10\": [\"Very unpleasant\", \"Very pleasant\"], \"q11\": [\"Very unattractive\", \"Very attractive\"], \"q12\": [\"Very dull\", \"Very pleasant\"], \"q13\": [\"Very unacceptable\", \"Very acceptable\"]}, \"q10LowAnchorAsPrinted\": \"Very full\", \"scenes\": {\"C2\": {\"tint\": \"clear\", \"floor\": 2}, \"BZ2\": {\"tint\": \"bronze\", \"floor\": 2}, \"BL2\": {\"tint\": \"blue\", \"floor\": 2}, \"R2\": {\"tint\": \"red\", \"floor\": 2}, \"C4\": {\"tint\": \"clear\", \"floor\": 4}, \"BZ4\": {\"tint\": \"bronze\", \"floor\": 4}, \"BL4\": {\"tint\": \"blue\", \"floor\": 4}, \"R4\": {\"tint\": \"red\", \"floor\": 4}}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f1f0ee;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d1b19;--muted:#5d5852;--accent:#7a4e2d;--line:#dcd6cf;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#f1e5d9}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 4px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\n.prompt{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0;text-align:center}\n.scene{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;background:var(--bg);padding-bottom:6px}\n.scene img{max-width:100%;max-height:42vh;width:auto;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px}\n@media (max-height:700px),(max-width:600px){.scene{position:static}}\n.it{padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.it .st{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:.96rem}\n.it .o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px}\n.it label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.25}\n.it label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.it label input{display:none}.it .an{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}@media (max-width:480px){.it .o{gap:3px}.it label{padding:9px 0;font-size:.86rem}}\n.it .an{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}\n.it.miss .o,.q.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:8px}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q:first-child{margin-top:0}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\ninput[type=text],input[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\nlabel.opt{font-size:.95rem}\ninput[type=text],input[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px}\n.brief{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--accent);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--ink)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs and questions: Yu, Wang &amp; Liang (2024), Buildings 14(6): 1799, Figures 2–3 and Table 1 (doi:10.3390/buildings14061799, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='tinted-window:state';\n  var ORIG=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('tw-original').textContent), IDS=ORIG.images;\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  var BG=['gender','age'];\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  var SEQV=['C-BZ-BL-R','R-C-BZ-BL','BL-C-R-BZ'];\n  function fresh(){var s=Math.floor(Math.random()*3),q=ORIG.sequences[s],o=[];[2,4].forEach(function(fl){q.forEach(function(t){o.push(t+fl);});});return {step:'intro',seq:s,order:o,k:0};}\n  function chs(q){return (q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return typeof c==='string'?{value:c,text:c}:c;});}\n  function field(n){var q=Q[n];\n    if(q.type==='text')return '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+(q.isRequired?'':' <span style=\"color:var(--muted);font-weight:400\">(optional)</span>')+'<br><input type=\"'+(q.inputType==='number'?'number':'text')+'\" inputmode=\"numeric\" id=\"t_'+n+'\" min=\"'+(q.min||'')+'\" max=\"'+(q.max||'')+'\" style=\"max-width:140px\"></div>';\n    return '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+chs(q).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Window views and room lighting</h1><p>This survey is about windows with tinted glass. You will see eight photographs of two hotel rooms on different floors, taken in front of the window with clear glass or with a coloured film. Imagine you are in the room and answer 13 short questions about each photograph. It takes about 10 minutes. Please use a screen with normal colours (no night mode or blue-light filter).</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='about';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\">'+BG.map(field).join('')+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var list=[];\n      for(var i=0;i<BG.length;i++){var n=BG[i],q=Q[n],v;\n        if(q.type==='text'){v=document.getElementById('t_'+n).value.trim();if(!v){if(q.isRequired){app.querySelector('[data-q='+n+']').classList.add('miss');return err('Please answer: '+q.title);}continue;}if(q.inputType==='number'){var x0=Number(v);if(!(x0>=(q.min||0)&&x0<=(q.max||150))||Math.round(x0)!==x0){app.querySelector('[data-q='+n+']').classList.add('miss');return err('Please enter a whole number between '+(q.min||0)+' and '+(q.max||150)+'.');}v=x0;}}\n        else{var x=app.querySelector('input[name='+n+']:checked');if(!x){app.querySelector('[data-q='+n+']').classList.add('miss');app.querySelector('[data-q='+n+']').scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return err('Please answer: '+q.title);}v=x.value;}\n        list.push(SPSite.answer(n,v));}\n      list.push(SPSite.answer('sequence',SEQV[st.seq]));\n      send(list,this,function(){st.step='scene';st.k=0;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function scene(){\n    var id=st.order[st.k],f=files[id],q=Q.rating;\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Photograph '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><div class=\"scene\"><img alt=\"Hotel room with a window, photograph '+(st.k+1)+'\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><h2>'+esc(q.title)+'</h2>'+(q.rows||[]).map(function(r,i){var nm='c__'+r.value,an=ORIG.anchors[r.value]||['',''];\n      return '<div class=\"it\" data-n=\"'+nm+'\"><div class=\"st\">'+(i+1)+'. '+esc(r.text)+'</div><div class=\"o\">'+[1,2,3,4,5].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+nm+'\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"an\"><span>1 '+esc(an[0])+'</span><span>5 '+esc(an[1])+'</span></div></div>';}).join('')+'</div>'+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(st.k<st.order.length-1?'Next photograph':'Finish')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var a={},miss=[];(q.rows||[]).forEach(function(r){var nm='c__'+r.value,x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+nm+'\"]:checked');if(x)a[r.value]=Number(x.value);else miss.push(app.querySelector('.it[data-n=\"'+nm+'\"]'));});\n      if(miss.length){miss.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('miss');});miss[0].scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return err('Please answer every question.');}\n      send([SPSite.answer('rating',a,{key:id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){st.k++;if(st.k>=st.order.length)st.step='done';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function clr(e){var r=e.target.closest&&(e.target.closest('.it')||e.target.closest('.q'));if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.miss'))err('');}}\n  app.addEventListener('change',clr);app.addEventListener('input',clr);\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='scene')return scene();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','rating','sequence'].concat(BG).forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{name:n};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('photos')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=IDS.filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"photos\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.order&&st.order.length===IDS.length&&st.seq!=null)||a.consent!==true)st=fresh();\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
